From: sixtyeightk <sixtyeightk@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 20] Arcus Odyssey host features

Everything the Arcus Odyssey build needs beyond patches 0001-0019, as one patch
(generated by tools/stage-repo.py from the engine it was tested with):
  - data folder (SDL_GetPrefPath) for an installed app on macOS and Linux;
  - a host screenshot hook; Escape left to the game's menu when it owns the hotkeys;
  - glue_run_guest_routine: run one of the game's routines from the host between frames;
  - GENESIS_AUDIO_SOLO capture aid (one FM channel only; no effect when unset);
  - Switch: applet-hook trace with timestamps, and a memory log.
Supersedes the development patches 0020-data-folder-for-any-installed-app.patch, 0021-audio-override-for-host-media.patch, 0022-switch-applet-trace.patch, 0023-switch-memory-log.patch.
Files: runner/audio.c, runner/audio/event_queue.c, runner/glue.c, runner/include/genesis_runtime.h, runner/main.c, runner/platform_switch.c, runner/platform_switch.h
